{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03203","headline":"和旻上人伤果禅师 · 杨炯","name":"和旻上人伤果禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"净业初中日，浮生大小年。\n无人本无我，非後亦非前。\n箫鼓旁喧地，龙蛇直映天。\n法门摧栋宇，觉海破舟船。\n书镇秦王饷，经文宋国传。\n声华周百亿，风烈被三千。\n芜没青园寺，荒凉紫陌田。\n德音殊未远，拱木已生烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}